# kgrep: pick a workload, type what to look for, matches highlighted
Output docs/kgrep.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1300
Set Height 560
Set Padding 18
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 80ms
Hide
Type "export PS1='demo $ ' && clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show
Type "kgrep"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "deploy api"
Sleep 1200ms
Enter
Sleep 1200ms
Type "orders"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 7s
